    of StreetSim. We use this component as a singleton manager. It''s sole responsibility
    is to do the following:


    1. Spawn an initial list of deactivated pedestrians
    and store references to them in memory, and

    2. Constantly shuffle and spawn
    pedestrian agents whenever they are enabled or disabled.'
